{"id":"198327ce38a3b80d","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-fredholm-alternative.md","title":"Fredholm Alternative","display":"thm-fredholm-alternative — Fredholm Alternative","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-fredholm-alternative","aliases":["58-thm-fredholm-alternative"],"display":"thm-fredholm-alternative — Fredholm Alternative","depends_on":["[[58-df-compact-operator]]","[[58-df-banach-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-fredholm-alternative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-fredholm-alternative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fredholm-alternative — Fredholm Alternative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28999e0c83253377\" href=\"?note=28999e0c83253377\" title=\"58-df-compact-operator\">58-df-compact-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,d_X\">\\(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,d_X\\)</span> (a fixed Banach-space structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K:X\\to X\">\\(K:X\\to X\\)</span> (compact operator on that structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_X\">\\(0_X\\)</span> (zero vector of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\)</span> (explicit Banach-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit compact-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28999e0c83253377\" href=\"?note=28999e0c83253377\" title=\"58-df-compact-operator\">58-df-compact-operator</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}alternative} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb F)\\land0_X\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x+_X0_X=x)\\Bigr)\\to\\left(\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;\\bigl(x+_X((-1)\\odot_XK(x))=y\\bigr)\\ \\lor\\ \\exists x\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq0_X\\land x+_X((-1)\\odot_XK(x))=0_X\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}alternative} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb F)\\land0_X\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x+_X0_X=x)\\Bigr)\\to\\left(\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;\\bigl(x+_X((-1)\\odot_XK(x))=y\\bigr)\\ \\lor\\ \\exists x\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq0_X\\land x+_X((-1)\\odot_XK(x))=0_X\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fredholm alternative: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I-K\">\\(I-K\\)</span> is bijective or the homogeneous equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I-K)x=0\">\\((I-K)x=0\\)</span> has a nonzero solution.</li>\n<li>It applies to compact operators on Banach spaces.</li>\n<li>The explicit predicates force the Banach structure, compact-operator structure, subtraction operation, norm, and scalar field to use the same witnesses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-compact-operator","status":"resolved","id":"28999e0c83253377","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)$ (explicit Banach-space predicate, see [[58-df-banach-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact-operator","status":"resolved","id":"28999e0c83253377","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S$ (fully explicit compact-operator predicate, see [[58-df-compact-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,d_X","display":false},{"tex":"K:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"0_X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}alternative} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(K;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X,d_X;\\mathbb F)\\land0_X\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x+_X0_X=x)\\Bigr)\\to\\left(\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;\\bigl(x+_X((-1)\\odot_XK(x))=y\\bigr)\\ \\lor\\ \\exists x\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq0_X\\land x+_X((-1)\\odot_XK(x))=0_X\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"I-K","display":false},{"tex":"(I-K)x=0","display":false}],"bytes":1516,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-fredholm-alternative.md|58-thm-fredholm-alternative]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["28999e0c83253377","ef59807ad934771f"]}